{
  "$schema": "https://vega.github.io/schema/vega/v6.json",
  "description": "Field names reached through `datum.name` in an expression. ECMA's identifier grammar is UnicodeIDStart/UnicodeIDContinue, which admits letter numbers, combining marks, connectors and the two zero-width joiners \u2014 a wider set than a letter-or-digit test.",
  "width": 260,
  "height": 110,
  "padding": 5,
  "data": [
